.Dd November 23, 2026
.Dt MDUTIL 1
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm mdutil
.Nd the metadata index's state
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl sEa
.Op Fl i Cm on | off
.Ar volume ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The system has no metadata index yet:
.Xr mdfind 1
searches the disk.
.Nm
reports indexing disabled for each
.Ar volume
(the mount point of each path given, or every volume with
.Fl a ) ;
.Fl i Cm off
and
.Fl E
have nothing to do, and
.Fl i Cm on
fails.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0, or 1 when a path cannot be read or indexing cannot be turned on.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mdfind 1 ,
.Xr mdls 1
